{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN14GMNReservedTagV","modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"title":"GMNReservedTag","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNReservedTag"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNReservedTag"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GMNReservedTag"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the payload of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/reserved(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", one of the two untyped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lanes of the tag model: a name, an optional identifier, a flat list of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameters, and a body of scoped symbols. Nothing here is interpreted — the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameters are whatever was written, in the order they were written, bound"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to nothing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"What lands here, and for how long","anchor":"What-lands-here-and-for-how-long"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three names land here "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"permanently","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", by decision rather than by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"omission: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"type":"text","text":", which GMN reserves but treats as a no-op, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrRenz"},{"type":"text","text":", which fall outside the 59-payload catalog. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catalog is closed, so this set does not grow or shrink."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything else that lands here is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"temporary, and lasts until the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normalizer runs","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". The parser never repairs and never discards, so a tag"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose parameters do not yet bind cleanly arrives here intact: an unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter, a raw identifier, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":", a unit on a slot that cannot"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry one, a value of the wrong type. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer"},{"type":"text","text":" repairs each of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"those and re-runs promotion, which is why "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"a parsed score is less typed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"than a normalized one","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns, the only names left on this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lane are the three above and the ones a defect no repair could reach kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"off a typed lane. Staying here is what carries such a tag to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator"},{"type":"text","text":", which reports it — see "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"What does not land here","anchor":"What-does-not-land-here"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A name GMN does not reserve at all is "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/custom(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", not this."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The distinction is drawn where tags are built, by the parser, which tests"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the name and sends it down one lane or the other."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Read, never written","anchor":"Read-never-written"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This payload has no public initializer. Every value of it comes from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser"},{"type":"text","text":", and the reason is that its admission rule is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"reservation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than the three permanent names above: a lossless parser has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\beam<bogus=1>"},{"type":"text","text":" before the normalizer repairs it, so any rule"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"narrow enough to keep a hand-built score well formed would be too narrow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the parser. Rather than pick one and lose the other, the lane is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"readable but not constructible — a hand-built tag reaches its meaning"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"through a typed payload, or through "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNCustomTag"},{"type":"text","text":" for a name GMN does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not reserve."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The three permanent residents are the price: none of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\port"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrHoos"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\DrRenz"},{"type":"text","text":" can be written into a hand-built score, though each still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"round-trips a parsed one untouched."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Guido Music Notation tag whose name GMN reserves but no typed payload"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"claims, carried in its untyped, as-written form."}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/body","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/ident-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/name-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNReservedTag\/parameters"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/d